text:
按当前精简方案，示例只记录“有定位价值的语义事件”，不记录所有控件点击。

### 1. 用户行动路径

```json
{"timestampEpochMillis":1764508810000,"level":"info","source":"flutter","event":"nav.enter","sessionId":"s_001","journeyId":"j_001","route":"device_home"}
{"timestampEpochMillis":1764508811200,"level":"info","source":"flutter","event":"device.connect.submit","sessionId":"s_001","journeyId":"j_001","details":{"device_type":"glasses"}}
{"timestampEpochMillis":1764508815000,"level":"info","source":"flutter","event":"device.connect.complete","sessionId":"s_001","journeyId":"j_001","details":{"device_type":"glasses","connection":"ble"}}
```

只记录页面进入、业务动作和结果，不记录 `button_123_clicked` 之类的控件事件。

### 2. 设备日志采集失败

```json
{"timestampEpochMillis":1764508820000,"level":"info","source":"flutter","event":"device_log.collect.start","operationId":"op_001","details":{"device_type":"glasses"}}
{"timestampEpochMillis":1764508828000,"level":"error","source":"native","event":"device_log.collect.fail","operationId":"op_001","details":{"error_code":"device_log_timeout","retryable":true}}
```

### 3. 全局异常

```json
{"timestampEpochMillis":1764508830000,"level":"error","source":"flutter","event":"error.captured","sessionId":"s_001","details":{"error_source":"flutter","error_type":"StateError","error_code":"device_state_invalid","fatal":false}}
```

Provider 异常：

```json
{"timestampEpochMillis":1764508831000,"level":"error","source":"flutter","event":"error.captured","details":{"error_source":"provider","provider":"deviceConnectionProvider","error_type":"TimeoutException","retryable":true}}
```

### 4. SDK 无法提供日志

```json
{"timestampEpochMillis":1764508840000,"level":"warn","source":"sdk","event":"sdk.log.export","operationId":"op_001","details":{"provider":"vendor_a","status":"unavailable"}}
```

不伪造 SDK 日志内容，只记录能力状态。

### 5. 归档清单

```json
{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "bundleId": "bundle_001",
  "createdAtEpochMillis": 1764508850000,
  "consent": true,
  "collectionWindow": {
    "startEpochMillis": 1764508800000,
    "endEpochMillis": 1764508850000
  },
  "files": [
    {
      "path": "events/flutter.ndjson",
      "size": 18420,
      "sha256": "<sha256>",
      "contentType": "application/x-ndjson"
    },
    {
      "path": "device/vendor_a.log",
      "size": 524288,
      "sha256": "<sha256>",
      "contentType": "text/plain"
    }
  ],
  "cleanupStatus": "pending"
}
```

敏感信息、完整账号、密码、Token、完整 MAC、输入原文和 URL 参数不进入日志。

这些无证据吗，或者有啥顾虑? `equipmentType` 是否必填 :  IOS 填了我们填就行了呀

1. `feedImgs/feedVedio/logFile` 的正式分隔格式： 这个双端有差异？&#x20;
2. `/user/auth/feedback` 是否同时支持 form body 和 query： 这个双端不一样？&#x20;
3. 日志上传失败时是否允许反馈正文继续提交
